&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;The Role&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The role is responsible for reviewing and challenging lending proposals across multiple verticals including SME Debt Finance, Property Development Finance, Corporate Lending &amp;amp; Leasing, Speciality Finance and Funds Finance.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Working closely with origination teams, product heads and the Head of Credit, the Senior Credit Director ensures that transactions are approved within risk appetite and credit governance is applied consistently across the platform.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This role is focused on transaction underwriting and credit governance.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The Senior Credit Director s a voting member of Private Credit Credit Committees and supports the Head of Credit in maintaining overall portfolio discipline and credit culture.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This role is focused on transaction underwriting and credit governance.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;/tr&gt;
