&lt;ul class=&quot;ul1&quot;&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;li1&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;s2&quot;&gt;Uphold Design Excellence:&amp;nbsp;Define and uphold the creative vision and standard across all digital brand, product, and interactive launch experiences.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;li1&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;s2&quot;&gt;Lead Product Storytelling:&amp;nbsp;Drive the end-to-end creative process for global product launches — from early-stage narrative concept through to final digital execution and delivery.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;li1&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;s2&quot;&gt;Be Hands-On with Craft:&amp;nbsp;Maintain an active, hands-on approach where needed, sitting alongside designers to guide UI, interaction design, and visual craft at key execution moments.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;li1&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;s2&quot;&gt;Navigate Embedded Dynamics:&amp;nbsp;Collaborate within a joint, cross-functional team of both AKQA and client-side designers, UX specialists, writers, and technologists.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;li1&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;s2&quot;&gt;Solve Complex Challenges:&amp;nbsp;Translate sophisticated product strategies and technical inputs into simple, compelling, and elegant digital narratives.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;li1&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;s2&quot;&gt;Act as a Trusted Partner:&amp;nbsp;Act as a confident creative partner, presenting and defending ambitious design work to senior internal stakeholders.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;li1&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;s2&quot;&gt;Mentor and Cultivate Talent:&amp;nbsp;Mentor and develop creative talent, fostering a high-performing, collaborative, and inclusive team environment.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;li1&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;s2&quot;&gt;Pioneer Modern Workflows:&amp;nbsp;Champion and implement modern design technologies and workflows — including motion design, spatial interfaces, rapid prototyping, and AI-assisted design tools.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;li1&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;s2&quot;&gt;Ensure Visual Consistency:&amp;nbsp;Establish tight creative feedback loops and design reviews to ensure absolute consistency across complex digital ecosystems.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;li2&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;s4&quot;&gt;Balance Ambition with Rigour:&amp;nbsp;Drive creative ambition while maintaining the discipline and focus required to deliver on high-stakes, time-sensitive launch schedules.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
