&lt;li class=&quot;li1&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;s2&quot;&gt;Launch-Experienced:&amp;nbsp;Deep, proven expertise in leading digital product launches, connected-experience storytelling, and interactive campaigns for global premium brands.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;li1&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;s2&quot;&gt;Systemic Thinker:&amp;nbsp;Strong expertise in building and scaling digital brand systems, interactive ecosystems, and responsive web platforms.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
