&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Our vision is a world where all businesses are powered by embedded payments.&amp;nbsp;Modulr&amp;nbsp;enables businesses, from SMEs to Enterprise, to grow their revenue, drive efficiencies and deliver fantastic customer experiences, by embedding payments into their products and operating systems.  We do this by providing products and services which allow our clients to efficiently collect,&amp;nbsp;reconcile&amp;nbsp;and disburse funds instantly via a range of payment schemes, accounts, and card products, fully controllable via API.  &amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;335559738&amp;quot;:240,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:240}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
