&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-pay-transparency&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pay-input&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;description&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-sheets-root=&quot;1&quot;&gt;Below is the annual On Target Compensation (OTE) range for candidates located in Germany. Your actual OTE, which is inclusive of base salary and incentive compensation, will depend on factors such as your skills, qualifications, experience, and work location. In addition, Okta offers equity (where applicable) and comprehensive financial benefits including paid time off and parental leave in accordance with our applicable plans and policies. To learn more about our Total Rewards program please visit: https://rewards.okta.com/deu.&lt;br&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;title&quot;&gt;The OTE range for this position for candidates located in Germany is between:&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pay-range&quot;&gt;&lt;span&gt;€196.000&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;divider&quot;&gt;&amp;mdash;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;€270.000 EUR&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;The Okta Experience&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;http://rewards.okta.com&quot;&gt;Supporting Your Well-Being&lt;/a&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.okta.com/company/okta-for-good/&quot;&gt;Driving Social Impact&amp;nbsp;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.okta.com/company/talent-connection-community/&quot;&gt;Developing Talent and Fostering Connection + Community&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We are intentional about connection. Our global community, spanning over 20 offices worldwide, is united by a drive to innovate. Your journey begins with an immersive, in-person onboarding experience designed to accelerate your impact and connect you to our mission and team from day one.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;Okta is an Equal Opportunity Employer. All qualified applicants will receive consideration for employment without regard to race, color, religion, sex, sexual orientation, gender identity, national origin, ancestry, marital status, age, physical or mental disability, or status as a protected veteran. We also consider for employment qualified applicants with arrest and convictions records, consistent with applicable laws.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;If reasonable accommodation is needed to complete any part of the job application, interview process, or onboarding please&amp;nbsp;&lt;a href=&quot;https://docs.google.com/forms/d/1EfiEYZrIyhA2X4Fijk0R3RKYOzNoS3wtvyM4nhbZnXE/edit&quot;&gt;use this Form&lt;/a&gt; to request an accommodation.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;Notice for New York City Applicants &amp;amp; Employees: Okta may use Automated Employment Decision Tools (AEDT), as defined by New York City Local Law 144, that use artificial intelligence, machine learning, or other automated processes to assist in our recruitment and hiring process. In accordance with NYC Local Law 144, if you are an applicant or employee residing in New York City, please&amp;nbsp;&lt;a href=&quot;https://talent.okta.com/new-york-city-aedt-notice.html&quot;&gt;click here&lt;/a&gt; to view our full NYC AEDT Notice.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;<p>Find <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.com">Jobs in Germany</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;h3&gt;Who we are&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Typeform is a refreshingly different form builder. We help over 150,000 businesses collect the data they need with forms, surveys, and quizzes that people enjoy. Designed to look striking and feel effortless to fill out, Typeform drives 500 million responses every year—and integrates with essential tools like Slack, Zapier, and Hubspot.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;h3&gt;About Typeform&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Typeform helps people create better conversations at scale.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Millions of people use Typeform to collect information, understand their customers, generate leads, run research, gather feedback, and power workflows across their businesses.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We are continuing to evolve Typeform from a form builder into a broader platform for collecting, understanding, and acting on information. AI is becoming a major part of that direction, both through experiences we build for customers and through making Typeform easier for AI agents and other products to interact with.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We are looking for a Senior Product Manager to help shape what comes next.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;The role&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As a Senior Product Manager at Typeform, you will own a meaningful product area and work closely with Engineering, Design, Data, Research, Marketing, and other teams to turn customer problems and business opportunities into products people genuinely want to use.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You will be responsible for understanding the problem space, setting product direction, deciding where the team should focus, and helping the team move from insight to execution.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This is not a role where Product simply writes requirements and hands them to Engineering.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We expect our Product Managers to be close to customers, opinionated about the problems worth solving, comfortable making decisions with incomplete information, and able to bring teams together around a clear direction.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You will balance customer value, product quality, technical considerations, and commercial impact while helping the team move quickly and learn.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;What you will do&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Own the strategy and roadmap for a key area of the Typeform product.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build a strong understanding of our customers, their workflows, and the problems they are trying to solve.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Identify opportunities through customer conversations, behavioural data, research, market insight, and product intuition.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Turn broad problems into clear product bets, hypotheses, and measurable outcomes.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partner closely with Design and Engineering from discovery through delivery.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Work with Data and Research to understand customer behaviour and evaluate whether what we build is working.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Make thoughtful prioritisation decisions across customer needs, business goals, technical investment, and product quality.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Define success measures and use them to guide product decisions before and after launch.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Run experiments where appropriate and use the results to shape future product direction.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Work with Marketing, Sales, Customer Success, and other teams to ensure we understand the wider customer and commercial context.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Communicate product direction clearly and build alignment across teams and leadership.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Help teams move from ideas to shipped experiences without losing sight of the original customer problem.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Look beyond individual features and think about how your product area contributes to the wider Typeform platform.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Explore how AI can improve the customer experience, change existing workflows, and create new ways for customers to get value from Typeform.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;What we are looking for&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You have significant experience building and scaling digital products, ideally within SaaS, product led growth, collaboration software, productivity tools, or another strong product environment.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Comfortable taking on messy, ambiguous product problems and bringing structure and direction to them.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A strong focus on customer problems and outcomes, rather than jumping straight to features.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong product judgement, with the ability to use customer insight, data, and context to make good decisions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Close collaboration with Engineering and Design, with product development treated as a shared discipline.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Able to set a clear product direction while staying practical about what the team should focus on next.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Confident making trade offs, making decisions, and explaining the thinking behind them.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Good judgement around when to experiment, when to research, and when there is enough evidence to move forward.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Clear communication, with the ability to adapt complex ideas for different audiences.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Commercial awareness and an understanding of how product decisions can influence activation, engagement, retention, expansion, and revenue.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Curiosity about AI and how it is changing the way products are built and how customers interact with software.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A real care for product quality and the details that shape a strong customer experience.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;You might be particularly strong in one or more of these areas&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;We do not expect every Senior Product Manager to have the same background.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Depending on the team, relevant experience could include:&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Product led growth, onboarding, activation, or retention&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Creation tools, editors, builders, or content creation experiences&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Platform products, APIs, integrations, or developer ecosystems&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Analytics, insights, research, or data products&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Pricing, packaging, payments, or monetisation&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;AI powered products, agents, automation, or intelligent workflows&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;B2B SaaS products used across multiple teams and use cases&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;*Typeform drives hundreds of millions of interactions each year, enabling conversational, human-centered experiences across the globe. We &lt;strong&gt;move as one team&lt;/strong&gt;, empowering our collective efforts by valuing each individual’s unique perspective. This fosters &lt;strong&gt;strong bonds&lt;/strong&gt; grounded in respect, transparency, and trust. We &lt;strong&gt;champion our diverse customer base&lt;/strong&gt; by anticipating their needs and addressing their challenges with priority. Committed to excellence, we&lt;strong&gt; hold high expectations &lt;/strong&gt;for ourselves and each other, continuously striving to deliver exceptional results.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We are proud to be an equal-opportunity employer. We celebrate diversity and stand firmly against discrimination and harassment of any kind—whether based on race, color, ancestry, religion, sex, national origin, sexual orientation, age, citizenship, marital status, disability, gender identity or expression, or veteran status. Everyone is welcome here.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;<p>Find more <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.com/english-speaking-jobs">English Speaking Jobs in Germany</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;The world of digital assets is accelerating in speed, magnitude, and complexity, opening the door to new ways for leveraging the blockchain. Fireblocks’ platform and network provide the simplest and most secure way for companies to work with digital assets and it trusted by some of the largest financial institutions, banks, globally-recognized brands, and Web3 companies in the world, including BNY Mellon, BNP Paribas, ANZ Bank, Revolut, and thousands more.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About Fireblocks&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;Fireblocks is the institutional standard for digital asset security and settlement. We enable banks, fintechs, and exchanges—like BNY Mellon, Revolut, and ANZ—to securely navigate the blockchain economy. Our platform and network provide the simplest and most secure way for companies to work with digital assets.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;The Mission: Quality&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;The Financial Apps unit builds the critical infrastructure that connects institutions to the digital asset economy. Our products cover everything from staking and yield to on-ramps, exchange integrations, and Web3 connectivity (e.g. WalletConnect).&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;In this role, you&#39;ll manually test all flows that need validation, and contribute to building out our automation the rest of the time. We need someone who treats quality as a holistic product challenge, takes pride in rigorous manual testing, and is eager to help grow our automation—using AI to move faster at every stage.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What You&#39;ll Do&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Holistic Quality Ownership:&lt;/strong&gt; You own the quality of the product end-to-end. You don&#39;t just test against a spec; you analyze the spec, find the logical gaps, and suggest improvements to ensure a better final product.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Hands-On Manual QA:&lt;/strong&gt; You design and execute thorough manual test plans across complex financial and Web3 flows.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;AI-Powered Velocity:&lt;/strong&gt; You leverage AI agents (e.g., Claude Code) to accelerate your workflow, expand coverage, and ship faster without sacrificing depth.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Deep-Dive Analysis:&lt;/strong&gt; You are comfortable digging into logs and monitoring tools (Datadog/Sentry) to understand why something broke. You aren&#39;t afraid to get your hands dirty in the backend to find the root cause.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Contribute to Automation:&lt;/strong&gt; When you&#39;re not running manual flows, you help build and maintain automation across backend APIs and frontend interfaces in a fast-paced environment.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Product Partnership:&lt;/strong&gt; You don&#39;t see yourself as &quot;just a tester.&quot; You are an engineer with a product mindset who actively works to improve the systems you are checking.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Who You Are&lt;br&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;You take real pride in finding what others miss — exploratory testing and edge-case hunting genuinely excite you, and you&#39;d rather break something today than let a user break it tomorrow. You do both automation and manual testing, and treat both as core parts of the role.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul class=&quot;[li_&amp;amp;]:mb-0 [li_&amp;amp;]:mt-1 [li_&amp;amp;]:gap-1 [&amp;amp;:not(:last-child)_ul]:pb-1 [&amp;amp;:not(:last-child)_ol]:pb-1 list-disc flex flex-col gap-1 pl-8 mb-3&quot;&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;font-claude-response-body whitespace-normal break-words pl-2&quot;&gt;3+ years in Manual QA&amp;nbsp;with hands-on automation experience across the full stack (TypeScript preferred).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;font-claude-response-body whitespace-normal break-words pl-2&quot;&gt;Solid grasp of blockchain fundamentals, the transaction lifecycle, and DeFi logic like staking and bridging.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;font-claude-response-body whitespace-normal break-words pl-2&quot;&gt;AI-native - you already use AI tools daily to move faster and cut through complex errors.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;font-claude-response-body whitespace-normal break-words pl-2&quot;&gt;Fast learner - new domains don&#39;t slow you down; you keep pace in an industry that moves at the speed of crypto.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;font-claude-response-body whitespace-normal break-words pl-2&quot;&gt;Data-driven debugger - when something breaks, logs are your first move, not your last resort.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Fireblocks&#39; mission is to enable every business to easily and securely access digital assets and cryptocurrencies. In order to do that, we strongly believe&amp;nbsp;our workforce should be as diverse as our clients, and this is why we&amp;nbsp;embrace diversity and inclusion in all its forms.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h6&gt;&lt;em&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.fireblocks.com/candidate-privacy-notice/&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;Please see our candidate privacy policy here&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/h6&gt;&lt;/div&gt;<p>Find more <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.com/english-speaking-jobs">English Speaking Jobs in Germany</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

&lt;p&gt;Captify, now part of Verve Group, is the leading Search Intelligence Platform for the open web and the largest independent holder of first-party search data outside of Google, connecting the real-time searches from over 2 billion devices globally. Its Search Intelligence technology powers omnichannel programmatic advertising and real-time insights for the world’s biggest brands, such as Disney, Unilever, eBay, Mercedes-Benz, Microsoft, Nestlé, GSK, Uber, Mars, P&amp;amp;G, Sony and Toyota—without reliance on third-party cookies. Captify brings brands more customers, publishers greater yield and consumers the most relevant digital experiences.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What we&#39;re looking for&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We are seeking a dynamic and client-focused Account Manager to join our team.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The Account Manager will act as the primary point of contact between clients/agencies and internal teams, ensuring seamless coordination and successful delivery of campaigns aligned with client objectives and KPIs.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This role requires strong client relationship management, excellent organisational skills, and commercial awareness. You will be responsible for managing multiple projects across omnichannel digital campaigns, including OLV, Display, and CTV, ensuring high-quality execution and consistent communication across all stakeholders.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;em&gt;This is a hybrid position with three days per week in our London Office (Covent Garden).&amp;nbsp;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What you’ll be doing:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Client Relationship Management&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build and maintain strong day-to-day relationships with clients with a key focus on retention&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Understand client campaign objectives, campaign goals and brand positioning&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Act as the primary point of contact for all campaign related communications such as campaign set ups, troubleshooting and identifying oppurtunities&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Support senior team members in delivering quarterly business reviews (QBRs) and strategic account reviews&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Manage client expectations and ensure high levels of satisfaction&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Campaign &amp;amp; Account Management&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Own the end-to-end campaign lifecycle, including internal briefing, checking accurate trafficking and QA, support for trader optimisation, in-flight reporting, and post-campaign analysis.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Coordinate campaign delivery across internal teams ensuring timelines, budgets, and objectives are met&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Monitor campaign performance and provide actionable insights through weekly reporting and PCAs&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Maintain accurate account documentation including briefs, status trackers, and campaign summaries&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Consitently identify opportunities for account growth and upselling services&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Internal Collaboration&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Act as the central point of contact between external clients and internal departments (Trading, Ad Ops, Creative, Insights, etc.)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Help to idenity internal platform gaps, challeneges or client needs&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ensure internal teams are aligned with client expectations and deliverables&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience using programmatic platforms (DSPs/SSPs) for campaign delivery and reporting&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience using CRM and reporting tools such as Salesforce&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience using data visualisation platforms like Tableau (or similar)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to interpret campaign performance data and translate it into clear, insight-led recommendations and client-ready presentations (PCA decks)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What you need to be successful:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;1-2+ years of experience in account management and/or client services, preferably within a media, advertising, or agency environment&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A good understanding of the digital advertising ecosystem, including media types and buys&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience supporting or managing omnichannel campaigns across digital channels (e.g. display, online video, and rich media formats)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Excellent communication, presentation, and stakeholder management skills, with confidence in client-facing situations&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong organisational skills with the ability to manage multiple clients, deadlines, and internal stakeholders simultaneously&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Comfortable working in fast-paced, deadline-driven environments with competing priorities&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proficiency in Microsoft Office and Google Workspace (especially Excel/Sheets and PowerPoint/Slides for reporting and presentations)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What We Offer&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Just a few of the benefits waiting for you at Verve:&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Stay healthy with our&lt;strong&gt; Bupa HealthCare Plan&lt;/strong&gt; with easy access to medical care&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Support your long-term financial security with our &lt;strong&gt;Aviva Corporate Pension Scheme&lt;/strong&gt;, with Verve contributing 5% of your qualifying earnings&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Pick what matters most to you in our &lt;strong&gt;Personalized Benefits Platform, &lt;/strong&gt;with a budget of&lt;strong&gt;&amp;nbsp; &lt;/strong&gt;£50/month&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Recharge with &lt;strong&gt;25 paid vacation days + 3 Wellness days &lt;/strong&gt;throughout the year, in addition to the public holidays&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Boost your professional knowledge with our annual training budget &amp;amp; internal webinars&lt;/strong&gt;… and even more reasons to join us!&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 8pt;&quot;&gt;Verve provides equal employment opportunities to all employees and applicants for employment and prohibits discrimination and harassment of any type without regard to race, color, religion, age, sex, national origin, disability status, genetics, protected veteran status, sexual orientation, gender identity or expression, or any other characteristic protected by federal, state or local laws.&amp;nbsp;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;If you are a California resident subject to the California Consumer Privacy Act, &lt;a href=&quot;https://verve.com/california-applicant-privacy-notice/&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;click here&lt;/a&gt; to understand how Verve processes your personal information and how you can exercise your rights.&lt;br&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 8pt;&quot;&gt;If you are located in the EU or UK visit our&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;a style=&quot;font-size: 8pt;&quot; href=&quot;https://verve.com/applicant-privacy-policy/&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;privacy policy&lt;/a&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 8pt;&quot;&gt; to understand how Verve processes your personal information and how you can exercise your rights.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;<p>Find more <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.co.uk/english-speaking-jobs">English Speaking Jobs in United Kingdom</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

&lt;p&gt;Captify’s unique search intelligence platform provides brands with a deep understanding of consumer interests, motivations, and intentions in real time, allowing for precise targeting and better campaign measurement. The underlying machine learning technology transforms real search intent into actionable marketing strategies that are used by over 800 leading global brands for programmatic activation, pre-campaign strategies, and unique measurement solutions. Captify is regularly recognised for innovation and excellence in advertising technology.&amp;nbsp; Captify UK recently won Campaign’s Ad Tech provider of the year award.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Captify is part of the Verve Group. Verve for Advertisers is a global, end-to-end advertising technology platform that helps brands and agencies reach target audiences across the open web. Operating as a full-stack ad exchange, it connects buyers with premium publishers across mobile apps, CTV, and digital screens.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What We&#39;re Looking For:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;isSelectedEnd&quot;&gt;This is a strategic commercial role responsible for driving long-term, sustainable revenue growth through the development, expansion and commercialisation of Captify&#39;s data partnerships.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;isSelectedEnd&quot;&gt;The role focuses on identifying and building high-value partnerships that extend the reach of Captify&#39;s data beyond its core media proposition, unlocking new revenue streams, accelerating adoption across strategy, activation and measurement, and enabling the commercial team to bring innovative products and solutions to market.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;isSelectedEnd&quot;&gt;Working cross-functionally with Commercial, Product, Marketing and Legal, this role will shape partnership strategy, negotiate commercial agreements, and build scalable relationships that deliver mutual value and support Captify&#39;s wider business objectives.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The ideal candidate combines deep knowledge of the data and adtech ecosystem with strong commercial acumen, relationship-building skills and a track record of creating strategic partnerships that drive measurable business growth.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What You&#39;ll Do:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Develop and execute Captify&#39;s commercial partnerships strategy, identifying opportunities to drive incremental revenue and expand the reach of Captify&#39;s data solutions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Identify, qualify and secure new strategic partners across the media, adtech and data ecosystem, with a clear focus on long-term commercial value.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead the end-to-end partnership lifecycle, from opportunity identification and outreach through commercial negotiation, contracting and launch.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build trusted senior-level relationships with partners, gaining a deep understanding of their commercial objectives, data strategies and growth opportunities.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Develop joint business plans that drive adoption, revenue growth and long-term partnership success.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Grow existing partnerships by identifying opportunities to cross-sell, upsell and introduce new products, markets and use cases.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Collaborate closely with Captify&#39;s Commercial teams to create shared pipeline opportunities and maximise revenue across all channels where Captify&#39;s data is available.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partner with Product, Marketing, Legal and other internal stakeholders to ensure partnerships are successfully onboarded, operationalised and supported.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Work alongside the Commercial Partnerships Account Manager to ensure partner SLAs are consistently achieved, whilst proactively identifying new opportunities to increase engagement and value.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Monitor market trends, competitor activity and emerging technologies to identify new partnership opportunities and inform commercial strategy.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Act as the internal voice of the partner, sharing market feedback and collaborating with Product teams to influence future product development and innovation.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Maintain accurate forecasting, pipeline management and regular reporting on partnership performance, commercial progress and future opportunities.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Work closely with UK Commercial Leadership to identify partnership opportunities that strengthen and support Captify&#39;s core business and go-to-market strategy.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What You&#39;ll Need:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;5+ years&#39; experience in commercial partnerships, business development or data sales within media, adtech, martech or digital advertising.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proven experience developing and growing strategic commercial partnerships that deliver measurable revenue growth.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong understanding of the digital advertising, audience data and identity landscape.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Demonstrated success negotiating complex commercial agreements with senior stakeholders.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Excellent relationship management skills, with the ability to influence both internal and external stakeholders at all levels.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Commercially minded with strong strategic thinking and problem-solving capabilities.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Highly collaborative, with experience working cross-functionally across Commercial, Product, Marketing, Legal and Finance.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Excellent communication, presentation and negotiation skills.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Comfortable operating in a fast-paced, evolving environment with strong attention to detail.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Willingness to travel for partner meetings, including occasional international travel, while working effectively within a hybrid or remote team.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;div&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What We Offer&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Just a few of the benefits waiting for you at Verve:&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Stay healthy with our&lt;strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;Bupa HealthCare Plan&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;with easy access to medical care&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Support your long-term financial security with our&amp;nbsp;&lt;strong&gt;Aviva Corporate Pension Scheme&lt;/strong&gt;, with Verve contributing 5% of your qualifying earnings&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Pick what matters most to you in our&amp;nbsp;&lt;strong&gt;Personalized Benefits Platform,&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;with a budget of&lt;strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;£50/month&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Recharge with&amp;nbsp;&lt;strong&gt;25 paid vacation days + 3 Wellness days&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;throughout the year, in addition to the public holidays&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Boost your professional knowledge with our annual training budget &amp;amp; internal webinars&lt;/strong&gt;… and even more reasons to join us!&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div&gt;
