&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;We are&amp;nbsp;seeking&amp;nbsp;a proactive and&amp;nbsp;conscientious&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Senior&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Management Accountant&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;to join our&amp;nbsp;UK&amp;nbsp;Opex&amp;nbsp;Finance team. This role will&amp;nbsp;be responsible for&amp;nbsp;the preparation,&amp;nbsp;review&amp;nbsp;and delivery of&amp;nbsp;high&lt;/span&gt;‑&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;quality&amp;nbsp;management information,&amp;nbsp;providing&amp;nbsp;meaningful insight into business performance and supporting stakeholders with effective decision&amp;nbsp;making.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;134233117&amp;quot;:true,&amp;quot;134233118&amp;quot;:true,&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:2,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:300}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
