&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Role Overview:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Ways of Working&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Office attendance: Mandatory office attendance on Tuesday, plus 2 other days (total 3 days per week in the office)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Flexibility: There is be flexibility which can be discussed with the line manager on the other 2 days you are in the office depending on workload and team projects&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Offsite working: There are no offsite working opportunities in this role&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What you&#39;ll do:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Support the commercial strategy team on daily / weekly reporting needs&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Work alongside the S&amp;amp;I team responding to requests on artist audiences and strategic projects&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Create presentations and trend reports to help convey findings and recommendations to the business&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Support with the management and analysis of tasks on our youth culture audience panel&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Manage the team’s reports and outputs, uploading them to our online portal&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Support the team with a wide variety of ad hoc projects and label workshops&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Opportunity to learn SQL &amp;amp; Snowflake as well as the various primary research approaches&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2 class=&quot;iCIMS_InfoMsg iCIMS_InfoField_Job&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Who you are:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Essential&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Prior experience of manipulating basic data in Excel &amp;amp; PowerPoint is essential as this is a major area of support required&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You may have had experience of using statistical packages such as SPSS, SAS, eViews or languages like SQL&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Good understanding of the music streaming landscape, music economics&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A love of music is essential! We’re lucky enough to work across all the labels at Sony so a varied taste and appetite for immersing in different genres and scenes is essential&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Nice to have&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
